<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Sherwin-Williams rating lower.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Sherwin-Williams rating lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it lowered its long-term 6-to-18-month rating of Sherwin-Williams Inc to market performer from outperform.</p>
<p>--It noted the paint manufacturer said it will acquire Thompson Minwax Holding Corp for $830 million in cash.</p>
<p>--Everen said Sherwin-Williams will leverage its extensive distribution system by adding Thompson's strong brand-name stains, Thompson and Minwwax. But the deal is also expected to dilute 1997 earnings by up to $0.05 per share, Everen said.</p>
<p>--Sherwin-Williams' stock closed down 1/2 at 55-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
